      "message": "I\u0027ll do a check. From local testing the symbolized `.odex` were up to 2x the size, though I didn\u0027t look at the compile + stripping runtime costs on the host. My guess is that if we only did this for preopted targets that actually generate meaninful compiled bits (either `speed` or `speed-profile` w/ a valid profile), the overall impact would be pretty minimal.",
